    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8192" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνελευθερ-ία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>illiberality of mind,
				servility,</i> joined with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολακεία,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				183b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				590b
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> esp. in
			money matters, <i>stinginess,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
